SUMMARY:Masha Campagne Group at Cloverdale Arts Alliance
DESCRIPTION:THE Jazz Club concludes its 2025-2026 season with the Masha Campagne Group. \nSan Francisco-based vocalist\, songwriter and producer Masha Campagne has been captivating audiences across the US and beyond with her rich\, sun-dappled voice\, with “come-hither intonations and dreamy sensuality” (Raul da Gama). A carioca at heart\, celebrated for her “delicious Brazilian jazz sound” (Andrew Gilbert) breaks out with a passionate love letter to Brazil releasing her fourth studio album\, Alegre Menina.Her Brazilian-inspired originals capture the soul of Rio—its rhythms\, its passion\, and its people. \nDoors open at 7:00 pm. Music starts at 7:30 pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/masha-campagne-group-at-cloverdale-arts-alliance/
LOCATION:Cloverdale Arts Alliance\, 204 N. Cloverdale Blvd.\, Cloverdale\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.8071;-123.018
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Cloverdale Arts Alliance 204 N. Cloverdale Blvd. Cloverdale CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=204 N. Cloverdale Blvd.:geo:-123.018,38.8071
END:VEVENT
