SUMMARY:The 85's at The Vintage Space
DESCRIPTION:Dance the night away with The 85s at Vintage Space! Relive the 80s with hits from Madonna\, Prince\, Billy Idol\, DEVO\, Men At Work and more! \nGet ready to travel back in time to the most tubular decade of all! The 85’s\, the Bay Area’s hottest 80’s tribute band\, are bringing the neon-soaked magic of the 1980s straight to Vintage Space at The Flamingo in Santa Rosa\, CA. Whether you’re longing for the edgy beats of Billy Idol\, the unmistakable riffs of Men at Work\, or the synth-heavy magic of DEVO\, this show promises a night packed with the best of 80s music. From the iconic sounds of The Fixx and The Pretenders to the pop brilliance of Madonna and Prince\, The 85’s cover it all with an electric energy that will have you dancing all night. \nThe 85’s are known for their high-energy performances and their ability to perfectly capture the spirit of the 80s with every song. They’re not just playing the hits—they’re living them\, bringing the sound\, style\, and swagger of a totally rad era back to life. With every guitar solo and synth groove\, they’ll transport you to a time when parachute pants were king\, shoulder pads were fierce\, and MTV was the ultimate source of cool. If you’ve been waiting for the right night to pull out your best 80s threads\, this is it! \nAnd what better place to enjoy these timeless classics than Vintage Space\, Santa Rosa’s retro-futuristic music lounge? Originally built in 1957\, this unique venue blends the nostalgia of the space race era with modern sounds and vibrant cocktails\, creating an atmosphere that’s truly out of this world. Don’t miss your chance to rock out under the Sputnik-inspired lights\, sip stellar drinks\, and dance the night away. Join us for an unforgettable night with The 85’s—where the past meets the future\, and every moment is pure 80s bliss.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-85s-at-the-vintage-space-2/
LOCATION:Vintage Space at The Flamingo Resort\, 2777 Fourth St.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.45182;-122.68916
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Vintage Space at The Flamingo Resort 2777 Fourth St. Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2777 Fourth St.:geo:-122.68916,38.45182
END:VEVENT
