SUMMARY:Cartilage / Laceration / Burning Palace / Cultural Warfare- Punk Music Night
DESCRIPTION:Four fierce bands. One explosive night of raw sound: metal\, punk\, and chaos collide live in Santa Rosa.\nBrace yourself for a high-intensity night at the California Theatre as Cartilage\, Laceration\, Burning Palace\, and Cultural Warfare take the stage. Delivering a relentless mix of metal\, punk\, and unfiltered energy\, this stacked lineup promises a night built for fans who like it loud and unapologetic. \nDoors open at 7 PM. Tickets are $20 in advance and $25 at the door. Come early\, grab your spot\, and get ready for an electrifying live experience in the heart of Santa Rosa. \nLimited tickets remain at caltheatre.com\, with additional tickets available via Eventbrite\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/cartilage-laceration-burning-palace-cultural-warfare-at-ca-theater-tickets-1985938663001
